@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #17334A
skinparam ArrowColor #42647A
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F0F7FA
skinparam classBorderColor #42647A
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F0F7FA
skinparam componentBorderColor #42647A
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #42647A
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #F0F7FA
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #42647A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF6DE
skinparam noteBorderColor #BCA76D
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction
actor "Patient" as Patient
actor "Staff administrator" as Admin
component "Web browser\nDjango templates + Bootstrap" as Browser
component "Authenticated API client" as APIClient
rectangle "AHM - Django application" {
 component "health_ai.views\nBrowser views / DRF endpoints\nand Django admin" as Views
 component "health_ai.forms / serializers\nInput validation" as Forms
 component "health_ai.services\nDataset previews / persistence" as Services
 component "ml.prediction\npredict_stroke()\npredict_lung_cancer()" as Predictor
 component "ml.model_loader / preprocessing\nJoblib loading + DataFrame inference" as Adapter
 component "ml.recommendation\nRule-based diet guidance" as Diet
}
database "MySQL\nConfigured application database" as DB
folder "datasets/\nLocal CSV training/preview files\nAbsent at inspection" as CSV
artifact "ml_models/*.pkl\nTrained scikit-learn pipelines\nAbsent at inspection" as Models
cloud "Kaggle download API\nOptional HTTPS dataset retrieval" as Kaggle
cloud "jsDelivr CDN\nBootstrap CSS / JavaScript" as CDN
Patient --> Browser
Patient --> APIClient
Admin --> Browser : /admin/
Browser --> Views : HTTP forms / session
APIClient --> Views : JSON prediction request
Browser ..> CDN : static resources
Views --> Forms
Views --> Services
Views --> Predictor
Views --> Diet
Views --> DB : ORM queries
Services --> DB : PredictionRecord save
Services --> CSV : local preview first
Services ..> Kaggle : download ZIP if local file\nmissing and keys configured
Predictor --> Adapter : attempt trained inference
Adapter --> Models : load artifact if present
note bottom of Predictor
Emerging technology: scikit-learn ML integration.
No model artifact is available in the inspected copy.
Current executable path uses heuristic fallback.
Diet guidance is rule-based, not learned.
end note
note bottom of DB
Evaluation used isolated SQLite, not this MySQL DB.
Kaggle previews are held in memory;
they do not create local training CSVs.
end note
@enduml
